abstract: >-
  These files contain facts and revision events for 50 selected CIKs from the
  edgar_fsds_submissions, edgar_fsds_facts, and edgar_fsds_revision_events tables.
  The snapshot id is sample-dataset-1/20260927T043424Z, and the extraction time
  is 2026-09-27T04:34:24Z. No upstream corpus-version identifier was established,
  so the snapshot id identifies these files. The facts.parquet file contains
  1548791 rows, facts.csv.gz contains 1548791 rows, revisions.parquet contains
  15539 rows, and revisions.csv.gz contains 15539 rows. The selection rule and
  query parameter templates are recorded in snapshot.json.
